{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235920/extras/39553b0699aa8518212bdfbd30e24acf.avif?t=1771774348\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 Forget the loyal dog\u2014you start with something far more personal: your wife, turned into a zombie after saving your life. Can you survive the ruins of an overrun city, find a way to cure her, and escape this hell together?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Mode 1 \u2013 Survival Mode</strong><br>Protect your home in a city swallowed by the undead. By day, scavenge for supplies, gather materials, and fortify your shelter. By night, hold the line against waves of ravenous, mutated horrors. Your wife, infected while shielding you, is still fighting the virus. Hunt rare herbs, take down the Prime Infected, and synthesize cusions to restore her humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Mode 2 \u2013 Infection Mode</strong><br>In a crowded urban district, the outbreak has just begun. Can you track down Patient Zero before the infection spreads? Fail, and watch the entire street fall into chaos\u2014each person turning before your eyes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>We've lost control</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235920/extras/60e686e5283f48308424bd1848c2e2c5.poster.avif?t=1771774348\" width=614 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235920/extras/60e686e5283f48308424bd1848c2e2c5.webm?t=1771774348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235920/extras/60e686e5283f48308424bd1848c2e2